      en: ["The fort was officially established by the British in 1768.", "It occupies the site of a former Courlander settlement from the 1650s.", "The walls are constructed primarily from local coral stone blocks.", "Several 18th-century cast-iron cannons remain on the site today.", "It is situated on the western promontory of Great Courland Bay.", "The fort served as a vital telegraph station during the 19th century."],
